<!--
  Hardened-runtime entitlements for the signed Mac app. Deliberately empty.

  The game's WebAssembly runs inside WKWebView's own WebContent process, which Apple signs with its own
  JIT entitlements, so the app does not need com.apple.security.cs.allow-jit or
  allow-unsigned-executable-memory. The native shell is plain compiled Rust: it loads no unsigned
  libraries and uses no camera, microphone, location or Apple Events. It is distributed with a
  Developer ID outside the Mac App Store, so it is not sandboxed and needs no sandbox entitlements.
  Add a key here only when a feature needs it, and say why.
-->
